WEBVTT

00:03:29.049 --> 00:03:32.674
with little to zero
news coverage whatsoever.

00:03:33.143 --> 00:03:34.603
Making matters worse,

00:03:34.627 --> 00:03:37.769
many papers have become ghost ships,

00:03:37.793 --> 00:03:39.896
pretending to sail with a newsroom

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:43.343
but really just wrapping ads
around filler copy.

00:03:43.883 --> 00:03:48.906
More and more newsrooms are being sold off
to companies like Alden.

00:03:49.328 --> 00:03:50.835
And in that meeting,

00:03:50.859 --> 00:03:53.593
their intentions
couldn't have been clearer.

00:03:54.174 --> 00:03:56.071
Harvest what you can,

00:03:56.095 --> 00:03:58.277
throw away what's left.

00:03:58.825 --> 00:04:03.450
So, working in secret
with a team of eight writers,